    # m 1ekd "I don't even want to think about what would happen if something important to you was struck."
    m 1ekd "Ni siquiera quiero pensar en lo que pasaría si algo importante para ti fuera alcanzado."

# game/script-topics.rpy:12492
translate spanish monika_poweroutage_7bd9d7e1:

